Derived files, generated by tools/ckvgen from Checkov's Terraform checks:
  engine/rules_parity.go     resource attribute checks (check IDs, resource
                             types, attribute paths and expected values)
  engine/rules_graph_gen.go  graph policy definitions

Changes: the checks were converted into TerraGuard's own rule format, given
TerraGuard rule IDs, titles, severities and remediation text, reviewed
against Checkov's test fixtures, and in some cases adjusted where a provider
default makes the original check report a false positive (see
tools/ckvgen/overrides.txt and tools/ckvgen/duplicates.txt). TerraGuard does
not include Checkov's source code. Checkov check IDs are kept as aliases so
that existing checkov:skip comments keep working.

The rules in engine/rules_port_*.go cover the same controls as Checkov's
custom-logic checks and were written in Go for TerraGuard; they cite Checkov
IDs for cross-reference only.

